{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":18,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["陶器的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對耶利米說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你去陶匠家，在那裡我有話告訴你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我便下到陶匠家，見他正用輪盤做器皿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他手中陶造的器皿做壞了，他就用那塊泥做成別的器皿，想怎麼做就怎麼做。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["這時，耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「以色列人啊，難道我不能像陶匠對待陶泥一樣對待你們嗎？以色列人啊，你們在我手中就像陶泥在陶匠手中一樣。這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["當我宣佈要剷除、推翻、毀滅哪一邦或哪一國的時候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["如果他們悔過自新，我必施憐憫，取消我原本要降給他們的災禍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["當我宣佈要建造和栽培哪一邦或哪一國的時候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["如果他們做我視為惡的事，不聽從我的話，我必改變心意，取消我原本要賜給他們的福氣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因此，你去告訴猶大人和耶路撒冷的居民，『耶和華說，我正計劃降災禍懲罰你們。你們要離開罪惡，改邪歸正。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他們卻說，『沒用！我們要隨心所欲，為所欲為。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"因此耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們問問列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看誰曾聽過這樣的事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女以色列竟做了一件極可怕的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩山嶺上的積雪會融化嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從遠方流來的冰涼溪水會停止嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，我的子民卻把我忘記，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向虛無的神明燒香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他們跌倒，偏離古道，走入僻陋的小路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他們的土地必荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永遠遭人嗤笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"經過此地的人無不驚懼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"搖頭歎息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在敵人面前驅散他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像東風吹散塵土一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他們遭難的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必以背相向，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不理睬他們。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["他們說：「來！我們設計對付耶利米吧，反正我們一直有祭司教導律法，有智者出謀劃策，有先知傳講預言。來吧！我們抨擊他，不要理會他的話。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你眷顧我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽聽敵人對我的指控。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人豈能以惡報善？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們竟設陷阱謀害我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你顧念我怎樣站在你面前為他們求情，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怎樣求你不要向他們發烈怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，求你讓他們喪身刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"兒女餓死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"妻子喪夫亡子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"男人被殺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"青年死於戰場！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當你使敵軍突襲他們時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們家中傳出哭喊聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們挖陷阱要捕捉我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"設圈套要絆我的腳。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你知道他們害我的各種詭計，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要赦免他們的罪過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要從你眼前塗抹他們的罪惡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你使他們倒在你面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你在烈怒中懲罰他們。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/18.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/19.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/17.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}